/*
   Ver.162 correctly reduced the overall Quick Add/search columns, but it also
   forced the Quick Add button itself to 88px and clipped it.  The user's 20%
   reduction target is the text input ("未整理タスクをクイック追加"), not the button.

   Keep the Ver.162 20:80 column reductions, while restoring the button to its
   intrinsic size.  With the button on max-content, all compression inside the
